{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01830",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 4.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I think it's my turn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.65,
      "end_seconds": 11.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.88,
      "end_seconds": 34.39,
      "duration_seconds": 16.51,
      "text": "Um, so... a swollen red eyelid. That's why I came. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.85,
      "end_seconds": 43.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.44,
      "end_seconds": 48.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "It's been going on for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.67,
      "end_seconds": 58.67,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "Right, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.6,
      "end_seconds": 81.94,
      "duration_seconds": 21.34,
      "text": "Honestly, a few times a day. I'd give it a five, out of ten. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. There's double vision as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.22,
      "end_seconds": 86.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "What about a fever, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.92,
      "end_seconds": 89.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.09,
      "end_seconds": 99.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.11,
      "end_seconds": 104.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.1,
      "end_seconds": 107.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.0,
      "end_seconds": 112.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.72,
      "end_seconds": 117.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.84,
      "end_seconds": 123.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.56,
      "end_seconds": 132.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.24,
      "end_seconds": 148.58,
      "duration_seconds": 15.34,
      "text": "Thyronorm. I take it 50 micrograms, every morning. I take allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day. So, I do miss it now and then, to be fair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.15,
      "end_seconds": 170.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Okay, have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.66,
      "end_seconds": 173.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.28,
      "end_seconds": 177.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.41,
      "end_seconds": 182.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "An underactive thyroid, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.12,
      "end_seconds": 188.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.43,
      "end_seconds": 190.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Yes, gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.29,
      "end_seconds": 192.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.73,
      "end_seconds": 200.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "I've had thin bones for two years now. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.96,
      "end_seconds": 222.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.51,
      "end_seconds": 228.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.18,
      "end_seconds": 232.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Any recent injury or sinus infection at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.56,
      "end_seconds": 235.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.47,
      "end_seconds": 239.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.68,
      "end_seconds": 242.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.69,
      "end_seconds": 247.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "So, and your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.46,
      "end_seconds": 251.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.78,
      "end_seconds": 255.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.96,
      "end_seconds": 267.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.83,
      "end_seconds": 296.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 121 over 68, respiratory rate 18, saturation 98 percent. And heart rate 92."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.89,
      "end_seconds": 303.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.6,
      "end_seconds": 307.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.85,
      "end_seconds": 322.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "The eyelid is swollen shut, the eye is bulging and the movements are painful and limited."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.75,
      "end_seconds": 353.07,
      "duration_seconds": 27.32,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Taking everything into account, it points towards orbital cellulitis. Let's get blood tests, for orbital cellulitis. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Let's get an urgent CT scan, for orbital cellulitis. You need admission today for intravenous antibiotics. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.11,
      "end_seconds": 359.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Actually, okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.56,
      "end_seconds": 363.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Let's plan a check straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.03,
      "end_seconds": 365.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.63,
      "end_seconds": 371.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.62,
      "end_seconds": 376.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I mean, thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.28,
      "end_seconds": 378.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}